{"type":"after","callId":"call@112","endTime":16225.198,"result":{"value":"TOANI VAULT\n\nTEE 保护中\n安全状态\n已通过\nCrypto\nAES-256\nAudit\nimmudb\n主要功能\n凭证管理\nToken 管理\n开发者中心\n系统管理\n用户管理\nToani.ai runtime\n\nSGX / SEV protected execution, attestation-aware access, and immutable audit tracing.\n\nrtk-bug-18218\nlayout.role.owner\n首页\n凭证管理\n\nTrusted credential operations workspace\n\n简体中文\nrtk-bug-18218\nlayout.role.owner\nTEE PROTECTED\n凭证管理\n\n安全存储和管理您的敏感凭证与密钥。\n\n过滤\n新建凭证\nTEE 加密保护\n所有凭证均使用 AES-256-GCM 加密存储于 TEE 可信执行环境。\n安全\n\n凭证总数\n\n4\n\n密码凭证\n\n4\n\nAPI 密钥\n\n0\n\nOAuth Token\n\n0\n\n过滤\n按服务标识、凭证类型和有效状态筛选。\n默认视图\n展开筛选\n凭证列表\n当前显示 4 条结果\n4 条总计\ntee-full-case10-20260413T212736\n用户名/密码\nID: 019d8714...\n创建于 2026/4/13 21:42:22\n删除\nui-tee-real-20260413-185715\n用户名/密码\nID: 019d868b...\n创建于 2026/4/13 19:12:39\n删除\ntee-real-20260413-185715\n用户名/密码\nID: 019d8684...\n创建于 2026/4/13 19:05:12\n删除\nlive-chain-20260413\n用户名/密码\nID: 019d8649...\n创建于 2026/4/13 18:01:14\n删除\nEnter confirmation code\n\nPlease check test-7226@privy.io for an email from privy.io and enter your code below.\n\nSuccess!\nDidn't get an email?\nResend code"},"afterSnapshot":"after@call@112"}
